.TH SECONDARY-SYNC 8 "2026-07-23" "rgbdns 0.1.1" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
secondary-sync \- refresh the packaged secondary zone
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B /usr/lib/rgbdns/secondary-sync
.SH DESCRIPTION
Internal package helper that locks the refresh operation, fetches the
configured zone with AXFR, compiles it, and atomically updates the managed
authoritative database.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B RGBDNS_STATE_DIR
Override the managed zone directory (default: /var/lib/rgbdns/tinydns).
.TP
.B RGBDNS_LOCK_FILE
Override the lock file (default: /run/rgbdns/secondary.lock).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/rgbdns/secondary.env
Defines ZONE and PRIMARY.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR axfr-get (1),
.BR rgbdns-setup (8)
